.gsd.migrating/activity/001-plan-slice-M005-S01.jsonl:{"type":"message","id":"f15d6811","parentId":"02cfa95c","timestamp":"2026-05-10T22:32:21.859Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"ollama_tc_0","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== heretek-swarm/heretek_swarm/actors/arbiter/__init__.py ===\n\"\"\"\r\nArbiter subpackage - Split module for arbiter agent.\r\n\r\nModules:\r\n- core: Core arbitration logic, conflict detection, enums, dataclasses\r\n\n=== heretek-swarm/heretek_swarm/actors/base/__init__.py ===\n\"\"\"\r\nActors base package - re-exports from base.py wrapper for backwards compatibility.\r\n\"\"\"\r\n\r\n# Import directly from core module to avoid circular import via base.py wrapper\r\n\n=== heretek-swarm/heretek_swarm/actors/chronos/__init__.py ===\n\"\"\"\r\nChronos Module - Temporal & Scheduling Specialist.\r\n\r\nThis module has been refactored from a single chronos.py file into\r\na package with separate components:\r\n\n=== heretek-swarm/heretek_swarm/actors/coordinator/__init__.py ===\n\"\"\"\r\nCoordinator Module - Multi-Agent Coordination Specialist\r\n\r\nThis module provides coordination capabilities for multi-agent systems including:\r\n- Task synchronization across multiple agents\r\n\n=== heretek-swarm/heretek_swarm/actors/dreamer/__init__.py ===\n\"\"\"\r\nDreamer Module - Creative Solution Generation & Divergent Thinking.\r\n\r\nThis module provides the DreamerAgent for creative ideation and divergent thinking.\r\nThe module has been refactored into separate components:\r\n\n=== heretek-swarm/heretek_swarm/actors/examiner/__init__.py ===\n\"\"\"\r\nExaminer Module - Quality Assurance & Testing Specialist.\r\n\r\nThis module provides the ExaminerAgent for quality assurance and testing.\r\nThe module has been refactored into separate components:\r\n\n=== heretek-swarm/heretek_swarm/actors/explorer/__init__.py ===\n\"\"\"\r\nExplorer Module - Intelligence Gathering Specialist\r\n\r\nThis module provides the ExplorerAgent for intelligence gathering,\r\nopportunity discovery, and anomaly detection.\r\n\n=== heretek-swarm/heretek_swarm/actors/habit_forge/__init__.py ===\n\"\"\"\r\nHabit-Forge Module - Behavior Architecture & Pattern Optimization.\r\n\r\nThis module provides the HabitForgeAgent for habit formation and behavioral\r\npattern optimization. The module has been refactored into separate components:\r\n\n=== heretek-swarm/heretek_swarm/actors/mixins/__init__.py ===\n\"\"\"Actor mixins for reusable functionality.\r\n\r\nThese mixins extract common patterns from actor files to reduce duplication.\r\n\"\"\"\r\n\r\n\n=== heretek-swarm/heretek_swarm/actors/nexus/__init__.py ===\n\"\"\"\r\nNexus Module - External Integration Specialist.\r\n\r\nThis module provides the NexusAgent for managing external API integrations,\r\nwebhooks, and protocol translation.\r\n\n=== heretek-swarm/heretek_swarm/actors/perceiver_plus/__init__.py ===\n\"\"\"\r\nPerceiverPlus Module - Advanced Analytics Specialist.\r\n\r\nThis module provides the PerceiverPlusAgent for advanced multi-modal analytics\r\nand pattern recognition. The module has been refactored into separate components:\r\n\n=== heretek-swarm/heretek_swarm/actors/prism/__init__.py ===\n\"\"\"\r\nPrism Agent Module - Multi-Perspective Analysis & Bias Detection.\r\n\r\nThis module provides the Prism agent for multi-perspective analysis and cognitive\r\nbias detection. The module has been refactored into separate components:\r\n\n=== heretek-swarm/heretek_swarm/actors/sentinel/__init__.py ===\n\"\"\"\r\nSentinel Module - Safety Guardian for Heretek Swarm.\r\n\r\nThis module provides the SentinelAgent class and supporting types for:\r\n- Input validation and sanitization\r\n\n=== heretek-swarm/heretek_swarm/actors/sentinel_prime/__init__.py ===\n\"\"\"\r\nSentinel-Prime Module - Security Commander & Threat Response.\r\n\r\nThis module has been refactored from a single sentinel_prime.py file into\r\na package with separate components:\r\n