\\milestones\\M007\\slices\\S01\\S01-UAT.md`. Do not edit roadmap checkboxes; the tool renders files and updates projections.\n14. Do not run git commands.\n15. Update `.gsd/PROJECT.md` with a full `write` only if the current project state needs refresh.\n\n**Autonomous execution:** no human is available. Do not call `ask_user_questions` or `secure_env_collect`; make reasonable assumptions and document them.\n\n**File system safety:** if re-reading task summaries, use `find .gsd/milestones/M007/slices/S01/tasks -name \"*-SUMMARY.md\"` or `ls .gsd/milestones/M007/slices/S01/tasks/*-SUMMARY.md`. Never pass `.gsd/milestones/M007/slices/S01` or any directory path directly to the `read` tool.\n\n**You MUST call `gsd_slice_complete` with summary and UAT content before finishing only after verification passes.**\n\nWhen done, say: \"Slice S01 complete.\"","display":false,"id":"e5a0b077","parentId":"7efc436c","timestamp":"2026-05-12T12:06:02.574Z"}
