arm/.actor_states` (24 actor state files)\n- `C:/Users/Derek/Desktop/heretek-swarm/heretek-swarm/.actor_states` (24 actor state files)\n\nBoth contain the same actor names (alpha, beta, charlie, steward, etc.). The goal is to collapse them into one canonical location.\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_16a0g3zqvfjf_1","name":"ask_user_questions","arguments":{"questions":[{"header":"Canonical Location","id":"m001_which_location","options":[{"description":"Actor states live alongside GSD workflow state — natural home for agent memory","label":"Root `.actor_states` (Recommended)"},{"description":"Actor states live inside the heretek-swarm Python package — self-contained module","label":"Nested `heretek-swarm/.actor_states`"},{"description":"Migrate to a dedicated top-level directory outside the app source tree","label":"New location (e.g. `swarm-state/`)"},{"description":"Consolidate both into a single location inside the Python package (`heretek_swarm/actors/`)","label":"Inside `heretek_swarm/actors/`"}],"question":"Which directory should be the canonical home for actor state files going forward?"},{"header":"Data Migration","id":"m001_migration_strategy","options":[{"description":"One set of files is source of truth; the other is stale from an old run","label":"One side is stale — delete the other (Recommended)"},{"description":"The two copies have diverged — need to reconcile/merge the data","label":"Both have live data — merge them"},{"description":"Both are stale — reset all actor state on migration","label":"Both are stale — reset all state"}],"question":"What should happen to the state files already in each location — is one side known to be stale, or do they have divergent live data?"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"MiniMax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":88,"output":820,"cacheRead":178944,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":179852,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778