.gsd.migrating/activity/002-discuss-milestone-M004.jsonl:{"type":"message","id":"95d60538","parentId":"06e13818","timestamp":"2026-05-10T02:10:36.284Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"ollama_tc_0","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== Test directory ===\ntotal 648\ndrwxrwxrwx 1 john john   512 May  7 21:11 .\ndrwxrwxrwx 1 john john   512 May  9 22:02 ..\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john     0 Apr 29 17:50 __init__.py\ndrwxrwxrwx 1 john john   512 May  7 21:11 __pycache__\ndrwxrwxrwx 1 john john   512 May  2 09:56 agent_workspace\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  3645 May  2 23:23 conftest.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 10215 May  1 20:36 test_actor_routing.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  9368 Apr 30 16:19 test_agent_factory.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 12338 May  1 21:45 test_agent_tools.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  9502 Apr 30 00:13 test_chronos_ticks.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  5120 May  2 22:59 test_cli_help.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 16557 May  1 00:12 test_cli_output.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 28521 May  1 22:59 test_config_cli.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 14147 May  3 13:13 test_consensus_api_auth.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  7396 May  2 00:53 test_cost_calculation.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 11251 May  1 23:41 test_cross_slice_mcp_routing.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  8621 Apr 29 23:14 test_daemon.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  8270 Apr 29 18:44 test_deliberation_flow.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  2608 May  2 22:44 test_docker_config.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 10566 May  1 00:42 test_end_to_end_s03.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 10828 Apr 29 22:41 test_heartbeat_bus.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  8133 Apr 30 22:53 test_historian_jsonl.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 11378 Apr 30 23:23 test_historian_pg.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 31485 Apr 30 22:54 test_living_loop_integration.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 10386 Apr 30 00:41 test_main_loop_s03.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 22903 Apr 30 01:59 test_main_loop_s04.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  9230 May  1 00:05 test_main_loop_s05.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  7962 May  2 17:58 test_mcp_bridge.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 27828 May  2 17:56 test_mcp_tool_toggle.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  5960 May  7 16:56 test_mixin_guards.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  9191 May  7 21:11 test_mixin_integration_s03.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 15498 May  2 07:24 test_model_garage_config.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  1170 May  2 22:16 test_packaging.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  7985 May  2 01:04 test_provider_stats_api.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 17324 May  2 07:57 test_providers_config_api.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  5155 May  2 23:13 test_readme_accuracy.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  7798 Apr 30 22:30 test_route_task.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 12798 Apr 29 22:28 test_steward_heartbeats.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 10326 May  7 20:34 test_stub_injection.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  9106 Apr 29 18:17 test_triad_analysis.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  6195 May  2 00:58 test_usage_recording.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 21664 May  3 15:23 test_workflow_api.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 19274 May  3 13:24 test_workflow_consensus_node.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 35618 May  3 15:52 test_workflow_data_flow.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 28245 May  3 16:01 test_workflow_e2e_nodes.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 31371 May  3 15:46 test_workflow_llm_node.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john 21637 May  3 15:56 test_workflow_validation.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  5467 May  1 13:00 test_ws_status_pump.py\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 john john  5857 May  2 23:23 test_ws_status_pump_integration.py\n\n=== Existing CI/workflow files ===\n./.github/workflows/ci-cd.yml\n./.github/workflows/ci.yml\n./.github/workflows/codeboarding.yml\n./.github/workflows/load-test.yml\n./.github/workflows/publish-npm.yml\n./.github/workflows/publish-python.yml\n./.pre-commit-config.yaml\n./docker-compose.yml\n\n=== conftest.py ===\n\"\"\"Shared pytest fixtures for the heretek-swarm test suite.\n\nProvides:\n* ``mock_agent`` — a ``unittest.mock.MagicMock`` pre-configured with the\n  ``agent_name`` attribute and a no-op ``run`` method.\n* ``mock_agent_dict`` — builds a dict populated with ``analysis_history``,\n  ``_analyses``, and ``_challenges`` for test-injectable state on mocked\n  agents.\n* An **autouse** fixture that clears ``get_supervisor().actors`` after every\n  test to prevent singleton state from leaking between tests.\n* A **pytest filterwarnings** entry that suppresses ``ResourceWarning`` —\n  these are emitted by unclosed ``aiohttp.ClientSession`` objects from\n  ``AgentActor`` heartbeat loops in integration tests.\n* A **logging filter** on the ``asyncio`` logger that suppresses\n  ``Unclosed client session`` messages — these are emitted by the event\n  loop's default exception handler during teardown when background tasks\n  created ``aiohttp.ClientSession`` objects that were not explicitly closed.\n\"\"\"\n\nimport logging\nimport warnings\n\nfrom collections.abc import Generator\nfrom unittest.mock import MagicMock\n\nimport pytest\n\nfrom heretek_swarm.actors.supervisor import get_supervisor\n\n\n# Ignore ResourceWarning from unclosed aiohttp.ClientSession objects —\n# these are created by AgentActor heartbeat background tasks in integration\n# tests and are harmless (cleaned up by the event loop on shutdown).\nwarnings.filterwarnings(\"ignore\", category=ResourceWarning, message=\".*unclosed.*\")\n\n\nclass _SuppressUnclosedSessions(logging.Filter):\n    \"\"\"Drop asyncio 'Unclosed client session' log records.\n\n    The asyncio event loop logs unclosed aiohttp sessions as ERROR-level\n    messages through the ``asyncio`` logger during event-loop teardown.\n    These are benign in the test suite (background heartbeat tasks create\n    sessions that are cleaned up when the loop closes).  Suppressing them\n    keeps ``pytest`` stderr clean and prevents false-negative verification.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def filter(self, record: logging.LogRecord) -> bool:\n        return \"Unclosed client session\" not in record.getMessage()\n\n\n# Apply the filter to the asyncio logger so structured-log and stdlib\n# handlers both see it.\nlogging.getLogger(\"asyncio\").addFilter(_SuppressUnclosedSessions())\n\n\n@pytest.fixture\ndef mock_agent() -> MagicMock:\n    \"\"\"Return a fresh ``MagicMock`` that looks like a ``swarms.Agent``.\n\n    The mock carries an ``agent_name`` attribute (``\"test-agent\"``) and a\n    ``run`` method that returns a preset string so callers get a real return\n    value without hitting an LLM.\n    \"\"\"\n    agent = MagicMock()\n    agent.agent_name = \"test-agent\"\n    agent.run.return_value = \"mock response\"\n    return agent\n\n\n@pytest.fixture\ndef mock_agent_dict() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Return a dict with per-agent attributes for deliberation testing.\n\n    Dict keys mirror what real ``AgentActor`` instances carry so that\n    downstream code can inspect ``analysis_history``, ``_analyses``, and\n    ``_challenges`` without instantiating real actors.\n    \"\"\"\n    return {\n        \"analysis_history\": [],\n        \"_analyses\": {},\n        \"_challenges\": [],\n    }\n\n\n@pytest.fixture(autouse=True)\ndef _clear_supervisor_actors() -> Generator[None, None, None]:\n    \"\"\"Autouse fixture — clear ``get_supervisor().actors`` after every test.\n\n    ``ActorSupervisor`` is a module-level singleton accessed via\n    ``get_supervisor()``.  Without this teardown, tests that spawn or inspect\n    actors would leak state into subsequent tests and produce flickering\n    failures when run in a different order.\n    \"\"\"\n    yield\n    supervisor = get_supervisor()\n    supervisor.actors.clear()\n\n=== test count ===\n43\n\n=== pyproject.toml tool sections ===\n[tool.pytest.ini_options]\r\nminversion = \"8.0\"\r\ntestpaths = [\"tests\"]\r\n--\n[tool.coverage.run]\r\nbranch = true\r\nsource = [\"src\"]\r\n--\n[tool.coverage.paths]\r\nsource = [\r\n    \"src/\",\r\n--\n[tool.coverage.report]\r\nprecision = 2\r\nshow_missing = true\r\n--\n[tool.coverage.html]\r\ndirectory = \"htmlcov\"\r\ntitle = \"Heretek Swarm Coverage Report\"\r\n--\n[tool.coverage.xml]\r\noutput = \"coverage.xml\"\r\n\r\n[tool.coverage.json]\r\noutput = \"coverage.json\"\r\npretty_print = true\r\n--\n[tool.ruff]\r\ntarget-version = \"py311\"\r\nline-length = 100\r\n--\n[tool.ruff.lint]\r\nselect = [\r\n    \"E\",      # pycodestyle errors\r\n--\n[tool.ruff.lint.per-file-ignores]\r\n\"tests/*\" = [\r\n    \"S101\",   # assert used\r\n--\n[tool.ruff.lint.isort]\r\nknown-first-party = [\"src\"]\r\nknown-third-party = [\"pytest\", \"pydantic\", \"opentelemetry\"]\r\n--\n[tool.mypy]\r\npython_version = \"3.11\"\r\nstrict = true\r\n--\n[[tool.mypy.overrides]]\r\nmodule = \"tests.*\"\r\ndisallow_untyped_defs = false\r\n"}],"details":{"target":{"kind":"file","action":"read","inputPath":"C:/Users/Derek/Desktop/heretek-swarm/.gsd/exec/e12d3244-0d4a-4d44-b560-247681846310.stdout","resolvedPath":"C:/Users/Derek/Desktop/heretek-swarm/.gsd/exec/e12d3244-0d4a-4d44-b560-247681846310.stdout"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1778379036280}}
.gsd.migrating/activity/002-discuss-milestone-M004.jsonl:{"type":"message","id":"7c2a689d","parentId":"95d60538","timestamp":"2026-05-10T02:10:59.267Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"ollama_tc_0","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:/Users/Derek/Desktop/heretek-swarm/.github/workflows/ci.yml"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"ollama_tc_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:/Users/Derek/Desktop/heretek-swarm/.github/workflows/ci-cd.yml"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"ollama_tc_2","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:/Users/Derek/Desktop/heretek-swarm/.github/workflows/load-test.yml"}}],"api":"ollama-chat","provider":"ollama","model":"deepseek-v4-flash:cloud","usage":{"input":160633,"output":472,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":161105,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778379036281,"inferenceMetrics":{"tokensPerSecond":0,"totalDurationMs":22887.352126,"evalDurationMs":0,"promptEvalDurationMs":0}}}
.gsd.migrating/activity/002-discuss-milestone-M004.jsonl:{"type":"message","id":"8641d3e3","parentId":"7c2a689d","timestamp":"2026-05-10T02:10:59.281Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"ollama_tc_0","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"name: CI/CD Pipeline\r\n\r\non:\r\n  push:\r\n    branches: [ main, develop ]\r\n  pull_request:\r\n    branches: [ main, develop ]\r\n\r\nenv:\r\n  PYTHON_VERSION: '3.11'\r\n  NODE_VERSION: '22'\r\n\r\njobs:\r\n  security-scan:\r\n    name: Security Scan\r\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\r\n    steps:\r\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\r\n\r\n      - name: Run Bandit Security Scan\r\n        run: |\r\n          pip install bandit[toml]\r\n          bandit -r src/ -f json -o bandit-report.json || true\r\n\r\n  lint-python:\r\n    name: Python Linting\r\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\r\n    steps:\r\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\r\n\r\n      - name: Set up Python\r\n        uses: actions/setup-python@v5\r\n        with:\r\n          python-version: ${{ env.PYTHON_VERSION }}\r\n          cache: 'pip'\r\n\r\n      - name: Install dependencies\r\n        run: |\r\n          pip install -e \".[dev]\"\r\n\r\n      - name: Run Ruff\r\n        run: ruff check src/ tests/\r\n\r\n      - name: Run MyPy\r\n        run: mypy src/ --ignore-missing-imports || true\r\n\r\n  lint-frontend:\r\n    name: Frontend Linting\r\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\r\n    steps:\r\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\r\n\r\n      - name: Set up Node.js\r\n        uses: actions/setup-node@v4\r\n        with:\r\n          node-version: ${{ env.NODE_VERSION }}\r\n          cache: 'npm'\r\n          cache-dependency-path: swarm-dashboard/package-lock.json\r\n\r\n      - name: Install dependencies\r\n        working-directory: swarm-dashboard\r\n        run: npm ci\r\n\r\n      - name: Run ESLint\r\n        working-directory: swarm-dashboard\r\n        run: npm run lint || true\r\n\r\n      - name: Run TypeScript check\r\n        working-directory: swarm-dashboard\r\n        run: npm run type-check || true\r\n\r\n  test-python:\r\n    name: Python Tests\r\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\r\n    services:\r\n      postgres:\r\n        image: postgres:16\r\n        env:\r\n          POSTGRES_USER: test\r\n          POSTGRES_PASSWORD: test\r\n          POSTGRES_DB: test_swarm\r\n        ports:\r\n          - 5432:5432\r\n        options: >-\r\n          --health-cmd pg_isready\r\n          --health-interval 10s\r\n          --health-timeout 5s\r\n          --health-retries 5\r\n\r\n      redis:\r\n        image: redis:7\r\n        ports:\r\n          - 6379:6379\r\n        options: >-\r\n          --health-cmd \"redis-cli ping\"\r\n          --health-interval 10s\r\n          --health-timeout 5s\r\n          --health-retries 5\r\n\r\n      qdrant:\r\n        image: qdrant/qdrant:latest\r\n        ports:\r\n          - 6333:6333\r\n        options: >-\r\n          --health-cmd \"curl -f http://localhost:6333/health || exit 1\"\r\n          --health-interval 10s\r\n          --health-timeout 5s\r\n          --health-retries 5\r\n\r\n    steps:\r\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\r\n\r\n      - name: Set up Python\r\n        uses: actions/setup-python@v5\r\n        with:\r\n          python-version: ${{ env.PYTHON_VERSION }}\r\n          cache: 'pip'\r\n\r\n      - name: Install dependencies\r\n        run: |\r\n          pip install -e \".[dev]\"\r\n\r\n      - name: Run tests with coverage\r\n        env:\r\n          DATABASE_URL: postgresql://test:test@localhost:5432/test_swarm\r\n          REDIS_URL: redis://localhost:6379\r\n          QDRANT_URL: http://localhost:6333\r\n        run: |\r\n          pytest tests/ -v --cov=src --cov-report=xml --cov-report=html --cov-report=term || true\r\n\r\n      - name: Upload coverage to Codecov\r\n        uses: codecov/codecov-action@v4\r\n        if: always()\r\n        with:\r\n          file: ./coverage.xml\r\n          flags: python\r\n          name: codecov-umbrella\r\n\r\n  test-frontend:\r\n    name: Frontend Tests\r\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\r\n    steps:\r\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\r\n\r\n      - name: Set up Node.js\r\n        uses: actions/setup-node@v4\r\n        with:\r\n          node-version: ${{ env.NODE_VERSION }}\r\n          cache: 'npm'\r\n          cache-dependency-path: swarm-dashboard/package-lock.json\r\n\r\n      - name: Install dependencies\r\n        working-directory: swarm-dashboard\r\n        run: npm ci\r\n\r\n      - name: Run tests\r\n        working-directory: swarm-dashboard\r\n        run: npm test -- --coverage --watchAll=false || true"}],"details":{"target":{"kind":"file","action":"read","inputPath":"C:/Users/Derek/Desktop/heretek-swarm/.github/workflows/ci.yml","resolvedPath":"C:/Users/Derek/Desktop/heretek-swarm/.github/workflows/ci.yml"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1778379059281}}
.gsd.migrating/activity/002-discuss-milestone-M004.jsonl:{"type":"message","id":"e7a5679d","parentId":"8641d3e3","timestamp":"2026-05-10T02:10:59.283Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"ollama_tc_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"name: Heretek Swarm CI/CD\r\n\r\non:\r\n  push:\r\n    branches: [ main, develop ]\r\n  pull_request:\r\n    branches: [ main, develop ]\r\n  workflow_dispatch:\r\n\r\nenv:\r\n  PYTHON_VERSION: '3.11'\r\n  NODE_VERSION: '22'\r\n\r\njobs:\r\n  # Python linting and type checking\r\n  lint-python:\r\n    name: Lint Python Code\r\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\r\n    steps:\r\n      - name: Checkout code\r\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\r\n\r\n      - name: Set up Python\r\n        uses: actions/setup-python@v5\r\n        with:\r\n          python-version: ${{ env.PYTHON_VERSION }}\r\n          cache: 'pip'\r\n\r\n      - name: Install dependencies\r\n        run: |\r\n          pip install -e \".[dev]\"\r\n\r\n      - name: Run Ruff linter\r\n        run: ruff check src/ tests/\r\n\r\n      - name: Run Ruff formatter check\r\n        run: ruff format --check src/ tests/\r\n\r\n      - name: Run MyPy type checker\r\n        run: mypy src/ --ignore-missing-imports || true\r\n\r\n      - name: Run Bandit security linter\r\n        run: bandit -r src/ -f json -o bandit-report.json || true\r\n\r\n      - name: Upload security report\r\n        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\r\n        if: always()\r\n        with:\r\n          name: bandit-report\r\n          path: bandit-report.json\r\n\r\n  # TypeScript linting\r\n  lint-typescript:\r\n    name: Lint TypeScript Code\r\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\r\n    steps:\r\n      - name: Checkout code\r\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\r\n\r\n      - name: Setup Node.js\r\n        uses: actions/setup-node@v4\r\n        with:\r\n          node-version: ${{ env.NODE_VERSION }}\r\n          cache: 'npm'\r\n          cache-dependency-path: swarm-dashboard/package-lock.json\r\n\r\n      - name: Install dependencies\r\n        working-directory: swarm-dashboard\r\n        run: npm ci\r\n\r\n      - name: Run ESLint\r\n        working-directory: swarm-dashboard\r\n        run: npm run lint || true\r\n\r\n      - name: Run TypeScript compiler\r\n        working-directory: swarm-dashboard\r\n        run: npm run type-check || true\r\n\r\n  # Run Python tests\r\n  test-python:\r\n    name: Run Python Tests\r\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\r\n    needs: [lint-python]\r\n    services:\r\n      postgres:\r\n        image: postgres:16\r\n        env:\r\n          POSTGRES_USER: heretek\r\n          POSTGRES_PASSWORD: test\r\n          POSTGRES_DB: heretek_swarm_test\r\n        ports:\r\n          - 5432:5432\r\n        options: >-\r\n          --health-cmd pg_isready\r\n          --health-interval 10s\r\n          --health-timeout 5s\r\n          --health-retries 5\r\n      redis:\r\n        image: redis:7\r\n        ports:\r\n          - 6379:6379\r\n        options: >-\r\n          --health-cmd \"redis-cli ping\"\r\n          --health-interval 10s\r\n          --health-timeout 5s\r\n          --health-retries 5\r\n      qdrant:\r\n        image: qdrant/qdrant:latest\r\n        ports:\r\n          - 6333:6333\r\n        options: >-\r\n          --health-cmd \"curl -f http://localhost:6333/health\"\r\n          --health-interval 10s\r\n          --health-timeout 5s\r\n          --health-retries 5\r\n\r\n    steps:\r\n      - name: Checkout code\r\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\r\n\r\n      - name: Set up Python\r\n        uses: actions/setup-python@v5\r\n        with:\r\n          python-version: ${{ env.PYTHON_VERSION }}\r\n          cache: 'pip'\r\n\r\n      - name: Install dependencies\r\n        run: |\r\n          pip install -e \".[dev]\"\r\n\r\n      - name: Run tests with coverage\r\n        env:\r\n          DATABASE_URL: postgresql://heretek:test@localhost:5432/heretek_swarm_test\r\n          REDIS_URL: redis://localhost:6379\r\n          QDRANT_URL: http://localhost:6333\r\n        run: |\r\n          pytest tests/ -v --cov=src --cov-report=xml --cov-report=html --cov-report=term || true\r\n\r\n      - name: Upload coverage to Codecov\r\n        uses: codecov/codecov-action@v4\r\n        if: always()\r\n        with:\r\n          file: ./coverage.xml\r\n          flags: python\r\n          name: codecov-umbrella\r\n\r\n      - name: Upload coverage artifacts\r\n        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\r\n        if: always()\r\n        with:\r\n          name: coverage-report\r\n          path: htmlcov/\r\n\r\n  # Run frontend tests\r\n  test-frontend:\r\n    name: Run Frontend Tests\r\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\r\n    needs: [lint-typescript]\r\n    steps:\r\n      - name: Checkout code\r\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\r\n\r\n      - name: Setup Node.js\r\n        uses: actions/setup-node@v4\r\n        with:\r\n          node-version: ${{ env.NODE_VERSION }}\r\n          cache: 'npm'\r\n          cache-dependency-path: swarm-dashboard/package-lock.json\r\n\r\n      - name: Install dependencies\r\n        working-directory: swarm-dashboard\r\n        run: npm ci\r\n\r\n      - name: Run tests\r\n        working-directory: swarm-dashboard\r\n        run: npm test -- --coverage --watchAll=false || true\r\n\r\n      - name: Upload coverage to Codecov\r\n        uses: codecov/codecov-action@v4\r\n        if: always()\r\n        with:\r\n          file: ./swarm-dashboard/coverage/coverage-final.json\r\n          flags: frontend\r\n          name: codecov-umbrella\r\n\r\n  # Security scan (standalone, no Docker dependency)\r\n  security-scan:\r\n    name: Security Scan\r\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\r\n    needs: [lint-python]\r\n    steps:\r\n      - name: Checkout code\r\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\r\n\r\n      - name: Run Trivy vulnerability scanner\r\n        uses: aquasecurity/trivy-action@master\r\n        with:\r\n          scan-type: 'fs'\r\n          scan-ref: '.'\r\n          format: 'sarif'\r\n          output: 'trivy-results.sarif'\r\n\r\n      - name: Upload Trivy results to GitHub Security\r\n        uses: github/codeql-action/upload-sarif@v3\r\n        with:\r\n          sarif_file: 'trivy-results.sarif'"}],"details":{"target":{"kind":"file","action":"read","inputPath":"C:/Users/Derek/Desktop/heretek-swarm/.github/workflows/ci-cd.yml","resolvedPath":"C:/Users/Derek/Desktop/heretek-swarm/.github/workflows/ci-cd.yml"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1778379059283}}
